			"notes": "-Now uses new AI from DBC (DB easy difficulty, DBZ medium difficulty, DBS hard, DBS Broly Insane, sometimes strong enemies have higher difficulty, eg: Cell full power is hard difficulty)\n-Add some quests from new DB Saga from Ben\n-Fix some typo in the Saga\n-Enemies in the saga starts with lower stats in the DB saga.\n-Now you start with lower stats, depends on the race. (Arcosian have higher starting stats)\n-Now classes only change starting attributs and does not change anything else."
		},
